  "claim": "Under this explicitly post-outcome donor-retention sensitivity and exact-date session-exchangeability assumption, identity-matched centered altitude profiles outperform their randomized-label reference in one already-examined non-bat species. This is not a rescued original primary test or independent cross-taxon confirmation.",
